          "attributes": {
            "definition": {
              "text": "# Alias Round Trip Runbook\n\nOperational runbook for Beaver NPS and CSAT monitoring.\n\n[Beaver \u2014 NPS & CSAT Monitoring](https://app.datadoghq.com/dashboard/yfh-kkv-47j)\n\nEmpty enhancer runs are healthy. Heartbeat monitors are independent of customer submission volume.",
              "type": "markdown"
            }
          },
          "id": "hta17cko",
          "type": "notebook_cells"
        },
        {
          "attributes": {
            "definition": {
              "text": "## Monitor: CSAT/NPS heartbeat missing\n\n### What this alert means\n\nThe NPS and CSAT enhancer CronJobs are each expected to run every five minutes. A missing heartbeat means the relevant job may be unhealthy (independent of organic submissions from users).",
              "type": "markdown"
            }
          },
          "id": "vl84bf52",
          "type": "notebook_cells"
        },
